{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_1_level_main_01-01_end",
  "groupId": "main_1",
  "stageId": "main_01-01",
  "title": "孤島",
  "storyCode": "1-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6b301b14d410218066ff3cc9532510b68d10abf780487bd3b7fdaeed9303f75c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第七关（后）\n時間未知 \\ 天氣未知 \\ 能見度 低\n切爾諾伯格 行動組E0所在地\nDr.{@nickname}營救行動 第三階段"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "這個診所......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "阿米婭，是不是以前我們來過那個？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......確實是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "只是怎麼......已經變成了，這個樣子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "已經人去樓空了......看來，是遭到了整合運動的襲擊吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "這難道就是那個感染者診所，阿撒茲勒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "明明掌握著整個切爾諾伯格的地下情報網，卻不肯和我們合作......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "那時，他們和整合運動之間的關係也十分模棱兩可......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "至少，如果他們當時肯向我們分享情報，或者僅僅是給個提示......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "我們也許就早點能離開這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "這種下場，是他們自作自受！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "也不全是這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "阿米婭，當時和他們交涉時你也在場吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "他們那傲慢冷漠的態度，我真是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "不能怪罪他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "頭兒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感染者本就很難相信別人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "經歷過那麼多苦難，當然會變得保守與頑固。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至少他們那樣做......我能理解，也願意原諒他們。不提防他人，就會被他人傷害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "何況，就連感染者之間，也是沒法輕易互相信任的。而且並不是每個人都願意像我們一樣冒險......"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "感染者診所？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "啊......他們是一家只醫治感染者的黑市診所。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "鑒於感染者的社會地位，大家是不可能在街道上抛頭露面的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "有些不願被拋進隔離區的感染者，依然也會在城市裡，小心翼翼地掩藏自己的身姿，苟活著......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "阿撒茲勒，就是向這些感染者提供服務的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......它們，一定是拒絕了整合運動的合作要求。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "博士，我之前和你說過，我們得了病吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......這種病，不僅會殺死我們，也會讓我們擁有不同於常人的力量。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "我不用法杖，就能釋放源石技藝哦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "然而，這種病，不止在生理上，會消磨我們的生命......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "它也會讓我們再也不能像正常人一樣生活。正常人的社會，會剝去你的一切。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "這座切爾諾伯格城，已經是所有規則的象徵了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "驅逐感染者，消滅感染者，鄙夷感染者，恐懼感染者......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "臨光",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "臨光",
          "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
          "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "最後，落到如此下場。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "可是，又有多少感染者，會有機會，選擇整合運動，甚至是其他的感染者組織，或者羅德島？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "大多數感染者，不過是失去了所有。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "這個診所，大概，也曾經是最後那麼幾個感染者，溫暖的家吧......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "礦石病是無藥可醫的。至少此時此刻，感染者只能在絕望中......痛苦地失去生命。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "而後他們的遺體......也會成為新的傳染源。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "不同於常人的特殊力量，染上之後就必然會死去的可怕傳染病——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "感染者......被這片大地上的多數人所恐懼。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "光是這麼兩三句話，博士大概也沒法切身體會吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "但當你面對這些問題導致的後果時......你會明白的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "你會明白，感染者的處境，究竟有多現實。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "像羅德島這樣不分彼此，或是整合運動那樣狂熱的排外擁內的感染者組織，都很少見。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "我能理解你的怒氣，但我也能理解那個小診所的苦衷。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "......我明白了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "可能，他們是真的碰上了什麼問題吧......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜賓",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "至少現在，我們的怨氣，都該和這個診所的曾經一樣，化作粉塵。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "羅德島的各位都是好人。也許會有很多人因畏懼與敵意，相互間產生了種種隔閡......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "但只要在羅德島，大家一定能解開誤會。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "阿撒茲勒......羅德島，又何嘗不是一個阿撒茲勒呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "......阿米婭......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "我們走吧，博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
